<title>DENMARK: Danish FIH issues 600 mln Dkk 4.0 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish FIH issues 600 mln Dkk 4.0 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Friday by arranger Landesbank</p>
<p>Schleswig-Holstein Girozentral (LB - KIel). </p>
<p>BORROWER: FINANSIERINGS INSTITUTET FOR INDUSTRI OG HAANDVAERK A/S (FIH).</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 600 MILLION DANISH CROWNS. COUPON:FOUR PERCENT.</p>
<p>MATURITY: 15 DECEMBER 2000.  PAYMENT: ANNUALLY ON DECEMBER 15.</p>
<p>ISS DATE: MARCH 11 1997 ISS PRICE: TO BE ADVISED</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969650</p>
</text>
